***************************************************************************
                     DiGits History File, v1.1
***************************************************************************

==== v1.1 ====

    - Fixed a small bug that allowed the player to select a highlighted
      square that did not have a number in it. This resulted in the human
      player actually skipping a turn and the Amiga getting an extra turn.

==== v1.0 ====

    - First release version.
    - Halloween, October 31, 1992.
    - From an original idea by Stephane Edwardson

